  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IWPR Boosting Citizen Watchdogs in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Boosting Citizens Watchdogs in Ukraine&quot; aims to enhance Ukrainian CSOs&apos; ability to investigate corruption, mismanagement of public resources, and opaque decision-making. It will do so both through direct support to CSOs in the form of subgrants, legal support as well as mentoring, trainings and workshops, in relevant thematic areas. Subgrants will go to investigative journalism organisations and independent media. Additionally, the programme will involve a large annual conference on the topic of transparency and anti-corruption, aiming to create networking opportunities between actors.</narrative>
  </description>
